{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國國防科技企業Anduril Industries宣佈，其首顆自主參與開發的衞星已經成功完成一項重要技術演示。衞星搭載的長波紅外傳感器能夠在沒有陽光照射的情況下探測其他航天器，通過捕捉目標釋放的熱輻射，填補傳統衞星監測系統在地球陰影區域存在的觀測盲區。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586292.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T13:42:11.591731+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T13:18:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T13:35:28.739535+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T13:35:28.739535+00:00","content_hash":"6aa76b64aa8a5f6907f7bbc9fdf55131fc365e1a8d930f792d4f2a54298eed3a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}